---
/**
 * Agentic loop: Goal → Plan → Tools/Act → Observe → loop or Finish.
 */
---

<figure class="diagram">
  <figcaption class="diagram__caption">
    <span class="mono-label">Diagram</span>
    Agentic workflow — plan, act with tools, observe, then loop or finish
  </figcaption>
  <div class="diagram__frame">
    <svg
      class="diagram__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 320"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="agent-title agent-desc"
    >
      <title id="agent-title">Agentic workflow loop</title>
      <desc id="agent-desc">
        Flow starts at Goal, goes to Plan, then Act with tools, then Observe. From Observe a loop
        arrow returns to Plan if more work is needed. A separate path from Observe goes to Finish
        when the goal is met. Step numbers 1 through 5 label Goal, Plan, Act, Observe, and Finish.
      </desc>

      <rect x="12" y="12" width="616" height="296" rx="4" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--rule)" />

      <!-- 1 Goal -->
      <g transform="translate(40, 36)">
        <rect width="130" height="56" rx="3" fill="var(--teal-soft)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="12" y="22" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--brand)">1</text>
        <text x="12" y="42" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Goal</text>
      </g>
      <path d="M178 64 H220" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-agent)" />
      <text x="186" y="56" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">start</text>

      <!-- 2 Plan -->
      <g transform="translate(228, 36)">
        <rect width="130" height="56" rx="3" fill="var(--cobalt-soft)" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="12" y="22" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--action)">2</text>
        <text x="12" y="42" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Plan</text>
      </g>
      <path d="M293 92 V120" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-agent)" />

      <!-- 3 Act -->
      <g transform="translate(228, 128)">
        <rect width="130" height="64" rx="3" fill="var(--cobalt-soft)" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="12" y="22" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--action)">3</text>
        <text x="12" y="42" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Act</text>
        <text x="12" y="58" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">Tools / actions</text>
      </g>
      <path d="M366 160 H408" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-agent)" />

      <!-- 4 Observe -->
      <g transform="translate(416, 128)">
        <rect width="140" height="64" rx="3" fill="var(--teal-soft)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="12" y="22" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--brand)">4</text>
        <text x="12" y="42" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Observe</text>
        <text x="12" y="58" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">Read results</text>
      </g>

      <!-- loop back to Plan -->
      <path
        d="M486 128 V88 H293"
        fill="none"
        stroke="var(--brand)"
        stroke-width="1.75"
        stroke-dasharray="5 4"
        marker-end="url(#arrow-brand)"
      />
      <text x="360" y="80" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--brand)">loop if not done</text>

      <!-- 5 Finish -->
      <path d="M486 192 V230 H293" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-agent)" />
      <g transform="translate(228, 238)">
        <rect width="130" height="48" rx="3" fill="var(--mist-deep)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.25" />
        <text x="12" y="20" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--ink)">5</text>
        <text x="12" y="38" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Finish</text>
      </g>
      <text x="380" y="220" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">goal met →</text>

      <defs>
        <marker id="arrow-agent" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L6,3 L0,6" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.25" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="arrow-brand" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L6,3 L0,6" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.25" />
        </marker>
      </defs>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <p class="diagram__legend">
    Solid arrows = forward steps (numbered). Dashed teal arrow = “loop if not done,” also labeled in
    the diagram.
  </p>
</figure>
